{
  "entries": [
    {
      "date": "July 17, 2026",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc3adfa3-ce3b-41ef-bdfd-9ca66d333e24",
          "alt": "Aurora"
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "h1",
          "text": "AviaClient 1.8.0"
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "hr"
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "Fixes"
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "Fixed AviaMenu where when the button reached its last button visible, It would cut the last button in the list in half. it now displays right"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "hr"
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "New"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "You now have the ability to export localPlugins into JS files",
            "Added a indicator to AviaMenu when you have more then can be visible in AviaMenu so you know to scroll",
            "Integrated ForceAppearance. Which Allows parts of AviaClient to still inject it's buttons no matter the language Set",
            "Added a Refresh button in the Title Bar. That Reloads Stoat on click",
            "Account Switcher, You now have full access to add accounts. And login to them with 1 click!",
            "What's New Now reads from a local backend instead of from a Online URL"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "hr"
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "Changes"
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "hr"
        },
        {
          "type": "spacer"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "Updated Dependencies",
            "Added a 5 New api's to Avia Menu. below Explains what every api. including existing. does"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Registers a button Via The API:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "`window.AviaMenu.register({ id: \"example\", name: \"example\", icon: \"example\", onClick: function });`"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Unregisters a button Via the API:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "`window.AviaMenu.unregister({ id: \"example\" });`"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Registers a button to the API that Acts as a submenu:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "`window.AviaMenu.submenuregister({ id: \"example\", name: \"example\", icon: \"example\" });`"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Adds a button to a submenu:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "`window.AviaMenu.submenu({ parent: \"example\", id: \"example\", name: \"example\", icon: \"example\", onClick: function });`"
        },
        {
          "type": "h3",
          "text": "Changes a SubMenu button to display other Text/Icon:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "`window.AviaMenu.updatesubmenu({ parent: \"example\", id: \"example\", text: \"example\", icon: \"example\" });` "
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
